##Version 3
As I mentioned in the development log, version 3 was tricky to get past so I had hit pause on it. However, I plan on completeing and going beyond it. What version 3 will consist of eventually:
- Allowing users to log-in to their own Google Drive account so the docs summarised will be saved in there instead, allowing full ownership.
- Each user having their own saved account.
- Email intergration, so the docs can be shared with another person or team.
- Improve the formatting of the new summarised document, right now it is a bit basic. 

