Eventually I hope to turn this simple documentation assistant into an enterprise tool. With:
- Multiple document types
- PDF support
- Workspace dashboard
- AI chat over documents
- Different AI models
- Summarisation templates
- Intergrations with internal systems

I hope to turn this personal tool into something that everybody can use. I see potential for agency's and other businesses being able to use this.
This simply wont be just a "documentation assistant" anymore, it will become a knowledge management system. 
